$$
\frac{60 \text{ servings}}{15 \text{ servings/carton}} = 4 \text{ cartons}
$$

The total cost for 4 cartons is:

$$
4 \text{ cartons} \times 4.00 \text{ dollars/carton} = 16 \text{ dollars}
$$

Thus, the amount of money Cynthia spends on ice cream after 60 days is:

